{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Open Lab API",
    "summary": "Read and write endpoints for Open Lab, a LessWrong-style ATProto forum.",
    "description": "Open Lab stores all content as records in users' ATProto data repositories (site.standard.* lexicons). Read endpoints are public; writes require an ATProto OAuth session and create records in the signed-in user's own PDS.\n\n## Versioning policy\n\nThe stable contract lives under `/api/v1/`. Additive, backward-compatible changes may occur within v1 without notice; breaking changes require a new major path segment (`/api/v2/`). When an endpoint is deprecated, responses carry IETF `Deprecation` and `Link` headers and a dated `Sunset` header is announced at least 90 days before removal. The unversioned `/api/*` aliases remain available during the deprecation window.\n\n## Errors\n\nAll error responses use RFC 9457 `application/problem+json` with a machine-readable `code`, human-readable `detail`, and a `resolution` hint.\n\n## Rate limits\n\nAPI responses advertise `RateLimit-Limit`, `RateLimit-Remaining`, `RateLimit-Reset`, and `RateLimit-Policy`; 429 responses include `Retry-After`. The default policy is 120 requests per client IP per 60-second window.\n\n## Other interfaces\n\nPages support markdown content negotiation via `Accept: text/markdown`, and an MCP server is published at `/.well-known/mcp` (Streamable HTTP JSON-RPC) with tools `get_frontpage`, `get_post`, and `list_concepts`.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "x-deprecation-policy": "Breaking changes ship under a new major path (/api/v2/). Deprecated endpoints respond with IETF Deprecation and Link rel=successor-version headers plus a dated Sunset header at least 90 days before removal."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://plrd-forum.vercel.app"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "read",
      "description": "Public read endpoints"
    },
    {
      "name": "write",
      "description": "Authenticated write endpoints (ATProto OAuth)"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/posts": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "listPosts",
        "summary": "List indexed posts (public JSON)",
        "tags": [
          "read"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 25,
              "minimum": 1,
              "maximum": 100
            },
            "description": "Maximum number of posts to return."
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Posts ranked by recency with karma and comment counts",
            "headers": {
              "RateLimit-Limit": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimitLimit"
              },
              "RateLimit-Remaining": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimitRemaining"
              },
              "RateLimit-Reset": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimitReset"
              },
              "RateLimit-Policy": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/RateLimitPolicy"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PostList"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Problem"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
